---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroPicture from '../assets/hero_picture.png';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main>
			<!-- Hero -->
			<section class="hero">
				<div class="hero-text">
					<p class="greeting">Hey, I'm</p>
					<h1 class="name">Gašper.</h1>
					<p class="bio">A Computer Science engineer who stepped away from code to help bring safer, breakthrough medicines to the world. In my free time, I cycle continents and explore the secrets of why we're here.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-image">
					<Image
						src={heroPicture}
						alt="Gašper Šircelj"
						width={3448}
						height={2940}
						class="portrait"
						loading="eager"
					/>
				</div>
			</section>
			<!-- About -->
			<section class="about">
				<div class="about-content">
					<p data-animate>I started my career writing code. From the start I knew I wouldn't be writing software forever, but I did know that I wanted to help people's lives using it. I studied Computer Science, spent time building and integrating software professionally, and only moved into a consulting role once that foundation felt solid.</p>

					<p data-animate>Today I work at Metronik as a consultant, working with pharmaceutical manufacturers across Europe. The facilities I work with produce some of the most advanced drugs in the world, aseptic biologics, breakthrough therapies, medicines that reach patients who have no other options. I help them run those facilities smarter and more compliant, so that what is manufactured is safer, more reliable, and made exactly right.</p>

					<p data-animate>At 25, before life had given me real responsibilities, I got on my bicycle in Slovenia and didn't stop pedalling until I reached Singapore. That took sixteen thousand kilometres, roughly 440 days, mostly alone. I had done it as a test to myself, to see how I react in lands that are foreign, in situations where I'm completely dependent on myself. It's incredible to see how much a person can change under such conditions and in such a short period of time. I came back a different person, ready to tackle whatever comes next.</p>

					<p data-animate>This site is where I write about what I'm thinking or studying. Feel free to roam around, contact me if you want to share something. I'm always in search of curious minds.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Recent Posts -->
			<section class="recent-posts">
				<div class="recent-posts-header">
					<h2 class="section-title">Recent writing</h2>
					<a href="/blog" class="see-all">See all →</a>
				</div>
				<div class="posts-grid">
					<a href="/blog/placeholder-1" class="post-card" data-animate data-delay="0">
						<span class="post-tag">Pharma</span>
						<h3 class="post-title">How aseptic manufacturing actually works</h3>
						<p class="post-excerpt">A look inside the cleanrooms where biologics are made, and why the margin for error is effectively zero.</p>
						<span class="post-date">August 2025</span>
					</a>
					<a href="/blog/placeholder-2" class="post-card" data-animate data-delay="150">
						<span class="post-tag">Cycling</span>
						<h3 class="post-title">What 440 days on a bicycle taught me about discomfort</h3>
						<p class="post-excerpt">Somewhere in Central Asia I stopped dreading hard days. Here's what changed.</p>
						<span class="post-date">July 2025</span>
					</a>
					<a href="/blog/placeholder-3" class="post-card" data-animate data-delay="300">
						<span class="post-tag">Psychology</span>
						<h3 class="post-title">Why smart people stay in the wrong rooms</h3>
						<p class="post-excerpt">On the pull of familiarity, sunk cost thinking, and why changing direction takes more than a decision.</p>
						<span class="post-date">June 2025</span>
					</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	@keyframes fadeUp {
		from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
		to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
	}

	@keyframes fadeIn {
		from { opacity: 0; }
		to   { opacity: 1; }
	}

	body {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		background:
			radial-gradient(ellipse 100vw 160vh at top right, #B1EEFF 0%, transparent 65%),
			radial-gradient(ellipse 150vw 110vh at bottom left, #B1EEFF 0%, transparent 65%),
			#F8F9FA;
		animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease both;
	}

	main {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.hero {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		height: calc(100vh - 64px);
		margin-top: 64px;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: transparent;
		position: relative;
	}

	.hero-text {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: flex-start;
		align-items: flex-end;
		padding: calc(100vh / 3 - 64px) 2rem 2rem 1rem;
		text-align: right;
	}

	.greeting {
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		margin: 0 0 0.15em 0;
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.2;
		animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease 1.0s both;
	}

	.name {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease 1.2s both;
	}

	.hero-image {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		justify-content: center;
		height: 100%;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.portrait {
		height: 100%;
		width: auto;
		max-width: 100%;
		display: block;
		object-fit: contain;
		object-position: bottom center;
		animation: fadeUp 1.2s ease 0.1s both;
	}

	.bio {
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
		max-width: 580px;
		text-align: right;
		animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease 2.0s both;
	}

	/* Recent posts section */
	.recent-posts {
		padding: 80px 2rem 100px;
		max-width: 960px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.recent-posts-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		margin: 0;
	}

	.see-all {
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.15s;
	}

	.see-all:hover {
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.posts-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.post-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.75rem;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
		border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
	}

	.post-card:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
		transform: translateY(-3px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
	}

	.post-tag {
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.post-title {
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 1.4;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		margin: 0;
	}

	.post-excerpt {
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		margin: 0;
		flex: 1;
	}

	.post-date {
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.posts-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	/* About section */
	.about {
		padding: 100px 2rem;
		background: var(--bg);
	}

	.about-content {
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.about-content p {
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		font-size: 17px;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		text-align: left;
		margin: 0 0 1.6em 0;
	}

	.about-content p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	/* Scroll animations */
	[data-animate] {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(20px);
		transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
	}

	[data-animate].is-visible {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(0);
	}

	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.hero {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			height: auto;
		}
		.hero-text {
			padding: 4rem 2rem 2rem 2rem;
		}
		.hero-image {
			height: 70vw;
		}
	}
</style>

<script>
	const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
		entries.forEach(entry => {
			if (entry.isIntersecting) {
				const delay = parseInt(entry.target.getAttribute('data-delay') || '0');
				setTimeout(() => {
					entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
				}, delay);
				observer.unobserve(entry.target);
			}
		});
	}, { threshold: 0.15 });

	document.querySelectorAll('[data-animate]').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
</script>
